glmark2: a Haiku native state (haiku-gl / haiku-glesv2 flavors: glmark2, glmark2-es2)

A BWindow whose view shows the frames Mesa's EGL "haiku" platform presents: its native
window is a BitmapHook (GetSize/SetBitmap), as libglvnd's BGLView passes it. Also: libdl is
optional on Haiku (dlopen() is in libroot).

